{
  "slug": "phantom-connect",
  "name": "Phantom Connect",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Phantom wallet integration for Claude Code - skills for Solana blockchain development, wallet operations, token management, and dApp building with Phantom.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **2 agents** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `add-social-login` (Configure Google and Apple social login with Phantom Connect SDK to enable embedded wallet creation), `phantom-connect` (Build wallet-connected applications with the Phantom Connect SDK for Solana), `phantom-wallet-mcp` (Execute wallet operations through the Phantom MCP server — get addresses, sign transactions, transfer tokens, buy tokens, and…), `send-sol-transaction` (Build and send SOL transfers with Phantom Connect SDK, including transaction construction, signing, and verification), `setup-browser-app` (Scaffold a vanilla JS/TS app with Phantom Browser SDK for wallet integration, without any framework dependency), `setup-react-app` (Scaffold a React app with Phantom Connect SDK for wallet integration, including social login and Solana support), `setup-react-native-app` (Scaffold a React Native (Expo) app with Phantom React Native SDK for mobile wallet integration, including polyfills and…), `sign-message` (Implement message signing with Phantom Connect SDK for Solana and EVM, including Sign-in with Solana (SIWS) authentication)\n- **Agents** (2): `phantom-integration-specialist` (Specialist agent for Phantom Connect SDK integrations — scaffolds projects, writes correct integration code, validates against constraints, and…), `phantom-wallet-agent` (Agent for executing wallet operations through the Phantom MCP server — get addresses, transfer tokens, sign transactions, swap…)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `phantom-connect-sdk`, `phantom-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install phantom-connect@claude-community` from `phantom/phantom-connect-cursor-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "agent": 2,
    "mcp": 2
  },
